<title>USA: Duramed Pharmaceuticals lays off 94 people.</title>
<headline>Duramed Pharmaceuticals lays off 94 people.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duramed Pharmaceuticals Inc said Wednesday that laid off 94 people today.</p>
<p>The company said the move is in keeping with its announcement last week, when it said it expects to report a third quarter loss of between $5 and $6 million before charges.</p>
</text>
